Where to install each thing
Software	Where to install?	Command
Ubuntu Update	✅ Ubuntu Terminal	sudo apt update
pip	✅ Ubuntu Terminal	sudo apt install python3-pip
Git	✅ Ubuntu Terminal	sudo apt install git
Python packages (Flask, psutil, etc.)	✅ Ubuntu Terminal	pip3 install flask
VS Code (Linux version)	✅ Ubuntu Terminal	sudo snap install code --classic
